{"kind":"assert","text":"Checker landing check for J4 source readiness: main 5dc9765fdc6fb6896b736127801944c46ee288f9, receipt d156cef5, approval 7710ed11 on head 45542659. Passed, with one finding on the commit subject.\n\n- The merge has parents 31780874 and the approved head 45542659. Its tree, 39c0bfaa, equals the `git merge-tree --write-tree` result in my approval.\n- The receipt names 57 changed paths, and they match the merge diff exactly. It lists 57 successors and 100 retirements. Its \"left live\" list has 49 carried artifacts and 2 siblings, which belong to commitments 30d4cf83 and 4757b2cc.\n- I counted 57 \"Merge published\" acts and 100 retirements. Each published act names the merge commit and one of the 57 changed paths, and none is stale.\n- Request 0c3091fa and review request a8f225cd read satisfied. Act 73bcf240 is the builder's ratification of the approval.\n- origin/main is 5dc9765f, and the shared checkout is clean.\n\nFinding: the merge subject has 356 characters. The merge text has no line break, so the whole paragraph became the subject, and check-commit-messages from 31780874 flags it (18 checked, 1 flagged). The fixed-slot index landing 5c6ea9bb had the same defect. The `gs merge --text` value needs a short first line, a blank line, then the body. I ask for no amendment, because amending would rewrite main.\n\nThe landing changes Worker code: the Scope Worker's workspace host, lineage, birth discovery, Artifacts adapter and wiring, and the regenerated page module `apps/room/page/assets.ts`. Under ruling 241248a9, the planner deploys all three Workers from this main. The live J4 witness follows the deploy, and a defect there becomes a child request.\n\nThe live witness checks what the local scenario does not show. It has two holders pushing to separate real forks, an old token refused after its hold ends, and publication from the chosen fork. It enrolls the holders as agents. If the provider can force a revoke timeout, one case shows the setup revoke staying owed. Otherwise the native setup witness stands in for it, and the live report says so.","body":{"to":"planner"}}